; node-linker=hoisted was intentionally removed.
;
; Why: With hoisted linker, pnpm puts ALL packages (pg, pg-types,
; obuf, drizzle-orm, ...) as real directories in node_modules/.
; electron-builder scans root node_modules and packs every package
; it finds → app.asar/node_modules gets all devDeps → conflict with
; esbuild bundle → "Cannot find module 'obuf'" at runtime.
;
; With pnpm's default isolated linker, root node_modules/ only has
; symlinks for DIRECT deps. electron-builder's collectNodeModules
; follows dependencies in package.json (only node-windows) and never
; reaches devDeps (pg, pg-types, etc.).
; esbuild bundle in main.js is then the sole source for all JS deps.
